    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d743">

                <pb facs="0863" n="767" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg767"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Straus.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-04-11"><hi rendition="#italic">April 11,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>What progress is being made in settlement of indemnity claims on basis of the
                    Sultan’s promise reported in your telegram of December 9 and your No. 28, of
                    December 12 last year? The President relies implicitly upon His Majesty’s
                    assurances and confidently expects an early adjustment will be reached, as the
                    matter is urgent. Settlement should include all outstanding claims. See my
                    instructions March 25.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
